---
---

<section id="architecture">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-label">Architecture</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Modular inside. One graph outside.</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">
      GraphQL handles querying.<br />
      <span class="sub-accent">Viaduct handles composition.</span>
    </p>
    <p class="section-subtitle arch-lede">
      Ownership lives in the modules. Not in a shared layer.
    </p>
    <p class="section-subtitle arch-lede">
      Each domain defines its data and relationships.
      Viaduct assembles the schema at runtime.
    </p>
    <p class="arch-punch mono">
      No central team stitching everything together.
    </p>

    <div class="arch-diagram">
      <div class="arch-client-wrap">
        <div class="arch-client">
          <div class="client-icon">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" />
              <path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="client-text">
            <span class="client-name">Any client</span>
            <span class="client-desc">browser, mobile, notebook, agent</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="arch-connector">
        <div class="connector-line single"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="arch-endpoint">
        <div class="endpoint-box">
          <span class="endpoint-label mono">POST /graphql</span>
          <span class="endpoint-header mono">X-UrbanMesh-Profile: &lt;profile&gt;</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="arch-connector">
        <div class="connector-line single"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="arch-server">
        <div class="server-box">
          <span class="server-name">Viaduct Server</span>
          <span class="server-tech mono">Kotlin/JVM · modular schema composition</span>
          <div class="server-modules">
            <span class="module-tag">:parcels</span>
            <span class="module-tag">:permits</span>
            <span class="module-tag">:transit</span>
            <span class="module-tag">:civic</span>
            <span class="module-tag">:census</span>
            <span class="module-tag">:environment</span>
            <span class="module-tag">:geography</span>
          </div>
          <span class="server-note mono">[each module owned independently]  ·  [one unified schema]</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="arch-connector">
        <div class="connector-line single"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="arch-db">
        <div class="db-box">
          <span class="db-name">PostgreSQL + PostGIS</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ownership-note">
      <h3 class="ownership-headline">The difficult part was ownership.</h3>
      <p class="ownership-sub">
        Querying was straightforward. Defining ownership was not.
      </p>
      <p class="ownership-q">
        Does a permit belong to <span class="mono">:parcels</span> or <span class="mono">:permits</span>?<br />
        Where is that edge defined?<br />
        Who is responsible when it breaks?
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="arch-notes">
      <div class="note">
        <span class="note-label mono">constraint</span>
        <p>This demo uses offline data.</p>
        <p class="note-dim">
          Production adds failure modes:<br />
          stale caches · partial failures · rate limits.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="note">
        <span class="note-label mono">tradeoff</span>
        <p>Clear ownership improves the system.</p>
        <p class="note-dim">It also requires discipline.</p>
        <p class="note-dim">A shared schema still creates shared responsibility.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-subtitle em {
    color: var(--text);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .sub-accent {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .arch-lede {
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .arch-punch {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text);
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
    background: var(--accent-dim);
    border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .ownership-note {
    margin-top: 64px;
    max-width: 720px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 24px 0 0 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .ownership-headline {
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.6vw, 1.9rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ownership-sub {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.55;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .ownership-q {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding-top: 4px;
  }

  .ownership-q .mono {
    color: var(--secondary);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .arch-notes {
    margin-top: 24px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    max-width: 840px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .note {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--secondary);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px 22px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .note:first-child {
    border-left-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .note-label {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .note p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .note p.note-dim {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .arch-notes {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .arch-diagram {
    margin-top: 56px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .arch-client-wrap {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .arch-client {
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 0;
    padding: 16px 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .client-icon {
    color: var(--secondary);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .client-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .client-name {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .client-desc {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .arch-connector {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .connector-line {
    width: 1px;
    height: 32px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--border), var(--accent-dim));
  }

  .connector-line.single {
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--accent-dim), var(--border));
  }

  .arch-endpoint {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .endpoint-box {
    background: var(--accent-dim);
    border: 1px solid rgba(232, 197, 71, 0.25);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px 24px;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .endpoint-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .endpoint-header {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .arch-server {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .server-box {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 24px;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .server-name {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .server-tech {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .server-modules {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .module-tag {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: var(--secondary);
    background: var(--secondary-dim);
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .server-note {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .arch-db {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .db-box {
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 0;
    padding: 16px 24px 0;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .db-name {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .db-detail {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
</style>
